+# Handoff: phone shop filter bottom sheet (WIP)
+
+Worktree: `/home/user/yallternative-living/.claude/worktrees/agent-a8e22f7c191d55c23`
+Branch: `worktree-agent-a8e22f7c191d55c23` (branched from `main`, then
+`git merge --no-edit claude/website-world-class-gaps-ox05mw` -- that merge is in
+and `syncShopUrl` from it is untouched). `npm ci` done. Nothing pushed.
+
+Goal (from the audit gap): on phones (<=767px) replace the wall of 9 category
+pills + 6 concern pills + scent select + sort select + Track Order button
+above the first product with one sticky "search | Filter (n) | Sort" row that
+opens a bottom sheet holding the SAME controls, plus removable active-filter
+chips above the grid. Desktop/tablet unchanged.
+
+## Done and verified
+
+- **Before measurement (taken, on the merged branch, before any edit):** at
+  375x667 the first `#shopGrid .card` top is **1535px** from the document top;
+  `.shop-toolbar` is 520px tall. Script: `scratchpad/measure.js` (ad-hoc,
+  not committed; it starts its own static server on :8097). No "after"
+  number yet -- CSS and JS are not written.
+- No suite has been run since the edits. `npm run build-data` has NOT been
+  run after the edits either (shop.html markers are still the hand-typed
+  defaults, which equal the content.json values, so the build should be a
+  no-op on them).
+
+## What is in the WIP commit (`1705cea`)
+
+1. `shop.html`
+   - Search form + old `.shop-toolbar` wrapped in `<div class="shop-controls" id="shopControls">`.
+   - New phone row `#shopMobileBar` with `#shopFilterOpenBtn` (contains
+     `#shopFilterCount` badge span, `hidden`, `aria-hidden`) and
+     `#shopSortOpenBtn`; both `aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="shopFilterSheet" aria-expanded="false"`.
+   - Active-filter chips row `#shopActiveFilters` (role=group, `hidden`,
+     `aria-labelledby="shopActiveFiltersLabel"`) holding sr-only
+     `#shopActiveFiltersLabel`, hidden `#shopChipRemoveLabel` ("Remove",
+     the shared first half of each chip's `aria-labelledby`),
+     `#shopActiveFiltersList` (JS fills), and `#shopClearFiltersBtn`.
+   - `#shopOrderStatusSlot` after `.shop-policy-note` (phone home for
+     `#openOrderStatusBtn`).
+   - `<dialog id="shopFilterSheet" class="shop-filter-sheet" aria-labelledby="shopFilterSheetTitle">`
+     with header (`#shopFilterSheetTitle`, `#shopFilterSheetClose` with
+     sr-only "Close" -- "Close" already exists in en.json as nav.close),
+     body slots `#shopSheetCategorySlot` (h3 "Category"),
+     `#shopSheetConcernSlot` (h3 "Concern"), `#shopSheetSortSlot`, footer
+     `#shopSheetClearBtn` (static "Clear all" fallback; JS must copy the
+     text of `#shopClearFiltersBtn` into it at init because build-data
+     replaces only the FIRST occurrence of a marker) and `#shopSheetApplyBtn`.
+   - Every new visible/sr string is a `<!--YL:shop.filterUi.<key>-->` marker.
+2. `assets/data/content.json`: `shop.filterUi` = { filterButton "Filter",
+   sortButton "Sort", sheetTitle "Filter & sort", categoryHeading
+   "Category", concernHeading "Concern", applyButton "Apply", clearAll
+   "Clear all", activeFilters "Active filters", removeFilter "Remove" }.
+3. `admin/config.yml`: Site Settings -> Shop page -> new collapsed object
+   "Phone filter bar wording" with those 9 optional string fields, hints on
+   each.
+4. `scripts/build-site-data.js`: `DEFAULT_SHOP_FILTER_UI` +
+   `resolveShopFilterUi()` (blank CMS field keeps the default), applied to
+   `CONTENT.shop.filterUi` right after content.json is read; both exported.
+5. `scripts/build-site-data.test.js`: 3 assertions on the resolver + one
+   assertion per key that `shop.html` carries its marker. Not yet run.
+
+## Not done (in order)
+
+1. **CSS** (`assets/css/styles.css`, toolbar block ~line 2952 and the
+   `.shop-toolbar:has(#filterRow:empty)` min-height ladder ~line 8615):
+   - `@media (max-width: 767px)`: `.shop-controls { position: sticky; top: var(--shop-bar-top, 65px); z-index: 90; background: var(--ink); display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; padding-block:8px }`,
+     `.shop-search { flex:1 1 auto; margin:0 }`, `.shop-mobile-bar { display:flex; gap:8px }`,
+     `.shop-toolbar { display:none }` (so the pre-rendered pills never flash
+     before main.js moves them), `.shop-order-status-slot .btn { width:100% }`.
+   - `>= 768px`: `.shop-mobile-bar, .shop-active-filters, .shop-order-status-slot { display:none }`
+     and `dialog.shop-filter-sheet` never opened.
+   - `.shop-mobile-btn` (pill-like, `var(--ink-2)` bg, `var(--hide)` border,
+     `var(--paper)` text, min-height 44px), `.shop-filter-count` badge
+     (`var(--rose-dim)` bg, `var(--on-fill)` text), `.shop-chip` /
+     `.shop-chip-clear` (wrap row, 8px gap, margin-bottom 12px).
+   - `dialog.shop-filter-sheet`: fixed, `inset:auto 0 0 0`, width 100%,
+     max-height 88dvh, top radius, `display:flex; flex-direction:column`
+     when `[open]`, scrollable `.shop-sheet-body`, sticky footer, slide-up
+     via `@starting-style` + `transition: transform/opacity/display allow-discrete`
+     like `dialog.gift-modal`; add `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { transition:none }`;
+     `::backdrop` like `dialog.global-search-modal::backdrop`;
+     `.shop-sheet-group:has(#concernFilterRow:empty) { display:none }`.
+   - `body.shop-sheet-open { overflow:hidden }` (scroll lock).
+   - Min-height ladder: drop every rung below 768px (628/587/544/503/460/419/370/327/322/233)
+     -- wrap the base rule in `@media (min-width: 768px)` at 233px and keep
+     the 904+ rungs. (Note: shop.html ships the pills pre-rendered by
+     build-data, so `#filterRow:empty` never matches today; the ladder is
+     dead weight but the task asked for it to go on phones.)
+2. **JS** (`assets/js/main.js`, inside `buildFilters()` ~line 6339; it
+   already owns `state`, `render()`, `handleResetFilters()`, `catLabel`,
+   `concernLabel`, `row`, `concernRow`, `scentSelect`, `sortSelect`,
+   `searchInput`):
+   - `renderActiveFilters()` called at the end of `render()`: chips for
+     `state.filter`, `state.concern`, `state.scent`, `state.query` (label =
+     `catLabel[]`, `concernLabel[]`, scent name, quoted query); each chip
+     `<button type="button" class="shop-chip" data-chip="category|concern|scent|q" aria-labelledby="shopChipRemoveLabel <chipSpanId>"><span id=...>label</span><span class="shop-chip-x" aria-hidden="true">×</span></button>`;
+     badge count = non-default category+concern+scent (query excluded from
+     the count, included as a chip); toggle `hidden` on `#shopActiveFilters`
+     and `#shopFilterCount`; set `aria-describedby="shopActiveFiltersLabel shopFilterCount"`
+     on `#shopFilterOpenBtn` only when count > 0.
+   - Chip removal: category -> `row.querySelector('.filter-pill[data-filter="all"]').click()`;
+     concern -> same on `concernRow`; scent -> `scentSelect.value="all"` +
+     `dispatchEvent(new Event("change"))`; q -> `searchInput.value=""; state.query=""; render()`.
+     `#shopClearFiltersBtn` and `#shopSheetClearBtn` -> `handleResetFilters()`.
+   - `initShopFilterSheet()`: `matchMedia("(max-width: 767px)")`; record
+     original parent + nextSibling of `#filterRow`, `#concernFilterWrap`,
+     `.shop-sort`, `#openOrderStatusBtn`; on match move them (appendChild,
+     never clone) into `#shopSheetCategorySlot`, `#shopSheetConcernSlot`,
+     `#shopSheetSortSlot`, `#shopOrderStatusSlot`; on change back, restore
+     with `insertBefore(node, nextSibling)` and close the sheet if open.
+     Event listeners are on the moved nodes / delegated on `row` and
+     `concernRow`, so they survive the move.
+   - open(trigger, focusEl): store trigger, `showModal()` (fallback
+     `setAttribute("open","")`), `document.body.classList.add("shop-sheet-open")`,
+     `aria-expanded=true`, focus `focusEl` (`#shopFilterSheetClose` for
+     Filter, `#sortSelect` for Sort). On the dialog `close` event: remove
+     body class, `aria-expanded=false` on both triggers, `trigger.focus()`.
